{"segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "SoupX 的 autoEstCont 会自动计算污染比例，这是其文档化能力。", "basis": "KG_GROUNDED", "citations": [{"index": 1, "quote": "autoEstCont
Automatically calculate the contamination fraction"}], "context_fact_ids": []}, {"index": 1, "text": "自动估计利用 soup 中高表达且为某群体标记基因的基因，通过 tfidf 方法识别标记基因，并在簇水平计算污染比例。", "basis": "KG_GROUNDED", "citations": [{"index": 2, "quote": "genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for
some population can be used to estimate the background contamination. Marker genes are identified
using the tfidf method (see quickMarkers). The contamination fraction is then calculated at the
cluster level"}], "context_fact_ids": []}, {"index": 5, "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 假设通道内存在多种不同细胞类型；若细胞高度同质，可能得到警告、错误或极高污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前数据一定不适用。", "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT", "citations": [{"index": 6, "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells. The fraction of background expression from gene g, bg, is then given by, (1)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
