\begin{equation*} b_{g} = \frac{\sum _d n_{g,d}}{\sum _d \sum _g n_{g,d}}, \end{equation*}\end{document}where ng, d is the number of counts for gene g in droplet d and the sum over d is taken over all droplets with <Nemp UMIs (Fig. 1). The species-mixing experiment allows us to compare how accurately bg recapitulates the true background expression found within each cell, revealing that any value of Nemp < 100 produces a good correlation, with the best correlation given when Nemp < 10 (Supplementary Fig. S2)."}], "context_fact_ids": []}, {"index": 6, "text": "提醒：手动指定污染比例仍是替代方案，不能据此推断自动估计必须执行或标记基因必须可用。", "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT", "citations": [{"index": 7, "quote": "It is also possible to manually specify the contamination fraction, which can be useful when the aforementioned estimation procedures are deemed inaccurate or it is desirable to overcorrect the data."}], "context_fact_ids": []}], "governance": {"statements": [{"statement_id": "statement-revision:e0d49a1d4b5649ba466c36d2:1", "statement": "The documented operator automatically estimates the contamination fraction.", "registered_statement": {"assertion_kind": "capability", "epistemic_status": "asserted", "object_id": "task:ambient-rna-estimation", "ontology_version": "2.0.0-core-review.1", "polarity": "POSITIVE", "predicate": "supports_task", "qualifiers": {"software_version": {"expression": "1.6.2", "status": "exact", "subject_id": "package-release:r:soupx:1.6.2"}}, "record_type": "StatementRevision", "schema_version": "sckg-ontology-core-5c-design-v1", "scope_status": "explicit", "statement_id": "statement:e0d49a1d4b5649ba466c36d2", "statement_revision_id": "statement-revision:e0d49a1d4b5649ba466c36d2:1", "subject_id": "operator-revision:r:soupx:autoEstCont:1.6.2"}, "predicate": "supports_task", "scope": {"status": "unknown", "dimensions": {"software_version": "unknown"}, "scope_status": "explicit", "qualifiers": {"software_version": {"expression": "1.6.2", "status": "exact", "subject_id": "package-releas