el estimates.", "scope_alignment": "aligned", "statement_revision_id": "statement-revision:a1664463eaa30dbc5a1ba535:1", "status": "completed", "subject_aligned": true, "support_type": "DIRECT_SUPPORT"}], "cautions": [{"caution_id": "evidence-gap:4c3364dadc943e4e9129c52d", "description": "Empty-droplet thresholds: Nemp examples are evaluated in species-mixing experiments; no global integer threshold or required order is extracted.", "evidence": [{"content_hash": "b6f3fe7d8bb03a06e6d2ffc7e569e29a79c3f732c0cc1bc137e19f04e3f4ac94", "end_offset": 4722, "evidence_span_id": "evidence-span:2e4085a95f94dd84bb75d467", "exact_text": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells. The fraction of background expression from gene g, bg, is then given by, (1)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
